psis":"Sagiri believes Shugen will be an ally and eagerly anticipates the expedition's arrival, but Shion is skeptical.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11522445/screencap/697caabf7cd28.jpg"},{"title":"Humans and Sages","synopsis":"As the expeditioners prepare, Gabimaru asks Mei if she's sure she wants to leave the island with them.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11522446/screencap/6987308f30a79.jpg"},{"title":"Hindering and Restoration","synopsis":"Gabimaru's group finally enters the sacred mountain, but the Tensen can see everything they're up to.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11522447/screencap/698f5d4a6204a.jpg"},{"title":"Two People and One Person","synopsis":"Gantetsusai and Fuchi struggle against Tao Fa, but they seem to be enjoying themselves.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11522448/screencap/699858d065f91.jpg"},{"title":"Chrysanthemum and Peach","synopsis":"When Tao Fa asks Ju Fa for help, Ju Fa recalls the time they spent together.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11522449/screencap/69a3a835325ee.jpg"},{"title":"Love and Karma","synopsis":"The expeditioners work together to take on Tao Fa and Ju Fa, who have undergone Kishikai transformations.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11522450/screencap/69ace7ab99993.jpg"},{"title":"Master and Student","synopsis":"Shion and Nurugai take on Zhu Jin, but both sides lack the ability to finish the other off.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11522451/screencap/69b623a8b5ab7.jpg"},{"title":"Ephemeralness and Fire","synopsis":"Gabimaru recalls the days he spent with Yui. How will his battle against Rien end?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11522452/screencap/69bf5ea0e83d2.jpg"},{"title":"Endings and Beginnings","synopsis":"As Gabimaru and his companions finish their respective battles, the additional expedition arrives.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11522453/screencap/69c8a80e49e00.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
